Readline: line editing and history of the interactive CLI (php84 -a),
with GNU readline of the package az.

The module readline of PHP 8.4 for php84 of azsupport/ports, which
installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20240924/readline.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php84/conf.d,
its headers in include/php84/php/ext/readline.
